{
 "segments": [
  {
   "id": "c02-title-01",
   "scene": "c02-title",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Chapter two. On a noun: the owner.",
   "pause": 0.6,
   "cues": [
    "title"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-owner-01",
   "scene": "c02-owner",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "A pronoun on a noun shows who owns it.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "b:0"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-owner-02",
   "scene": "c02-owner",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "It works like the second word of an iḍāfa.",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-owner-03",
   "scene": "c02-owner",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Zayd's book.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "b:1",
    "ex:0"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-owner-04",
   "scene": "c02-owner",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "كِتَابُ زَيْدٍ",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": [
    "ar:كِتَابُ زَيْدٍ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-owner-05",
   "scene": "c02-owner",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "His book.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-owner-06",
   "scene": "c02-owner",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "كِتَابُهُ",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": [
    "ar:كِتَابُهُ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-owner-07",
   "scene": "c02-owner",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Zayd is the owner, so it is jarr.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "note:0",
    "ar:زَيْدٍ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-owner-08",
   "scene": "c02-owner",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The pronoun for he takes its job.",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": [
    "ar:ـهُ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-owner-09",
   "scene": "c02-owner",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "His book is new.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "ex:1"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-owner-10",
   "scene": "c02-owner",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "كِتَابُهُ جَدِيدٌ",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": [
    "ar:كِتَابُهُ جَدِيدٌ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-owner-11",
   "scene": "c02-owner",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The pronoun for he is the owner.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "note:1",
    "ar:ـهُ#2"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-owner-12",
   "scene": "c02-owner",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "It is fixed, so it does not change its ending. It is in the place of jarr.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-owner-13",
   "scene": "c02-owner",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "فِي مَحَلِّ جَرٍّ",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": [
    "ar:فِي مَحَلِّ جَرٍّ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-owner-14",
   "scene": "c02-owner",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Her house is near.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "ex:2"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-owner-15",
   "scene": "c02-owner",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "بَيْتُهَا قَرِيبٌ",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": [
    "ar:بَيْتُهَا قَرِيبٌ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-owner-16",
   "scene": "c02-owner",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The pronoun for she is the owner, in the place of jarr.",
   "pause": 0.6,
   "cues": [
    "note:2",
    "ar:ـهَا"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-rule-01",
   "scene": "c02-rule",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "No al, no tanween.",
   "pause": 0.35,
   "cues": [
    "b:0",
    "ar:ال",
    "hl:no tanween"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-rule-02",
   "scene": "c02-rule",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "A noun with an attached pronoun is the first word of an iḍāfa.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "hl:the first word of an iḍāfa"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-rule-03",
   "scene": "c02-rule",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "So it has no al and no tanween.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "ar:ال#2"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-rule-04",
   "scene": "c02-rule",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "A book,",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-rule-05",
   "scene": "c02-rule",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "كِتَابٌ",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": [
    "ar:كِتَابٌ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-rule-06",
   "scene": "c02-rule",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "becomes his book.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-rule-07",
   "scene": "c02-rule",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "كِتَابُهُ",
   "pause": 0.7,
   "cues": [
    "ar:كِتَابُهُ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-endings-01",
   "scene": "c02-endings",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The noun still shows its own ending before the pronoun.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "b:0"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-endings-02",
   "scene": "c02-endings",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Only the noun is flexible. The pronoun stays the same.",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-endings-03",
   "scene": "c02-endings",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "His book is new.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "b:1",
    "ex:0"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-endings-04",
   "scene": "c02-endings",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "كِتَابُهُ جَدِيدٌ",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": [
    "ar:كِتَابُهُ جَدِيدٌ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-endings-05",
   "scene": "c02-endings",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The word for book is the Topic. It is rafʿ, with damma.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "note:0",
    "ar:كِتَابُ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-endings-06",
   "scene": "c02-endings",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "كِتَابُ",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": [
    "ar:كِتَابُ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-endings-07",
   "scene": "c02-endings",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The student read his book.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "ex:1"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-endings-08",
   "scene": "c02-endings",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "قَرَأَ الطَّالِبُ كِتَابَهُ",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": [
    "ar:قَرَأَ الطَّالِبُ كِتَابَهُ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-endings-09",
   "scene": "c02-endings",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The word for book is the object. It is naṣb, with fatha.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "note:1",
    "ar:كِتَابَ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-endings-10",
   "scene": "c02-endings",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "كِتَابَ",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": [
    "ar:كِتَابَ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-endings-11",
   "scene": "c02-endings",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The pen is in his book.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "ex:2"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-endings-12",
   "scene": "c02-endings",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "القَلَمُ فِي كِتَابِهِ",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": [
    "ar:القَلَمُ فِي كِتَابِهِ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-endings-13",
   "scene": "c02-endings",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The word for book comes after the preposition meaning in. It is jarr, with kasra.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "note:2",
    "ar:كِتَابِ",
    "ar:فِي"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-endings-14",
   "scene": "c02-endings",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "كِتَابِ",
   "pause": 0.7,
   "cues": [
    "ar:كِتَابِ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-tip-01",
   "scene": "c02-tip",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "A spelling tip. Look at a word that ends in this letter.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "b:0",
    "ar:ة"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-tip-02",
   "scene": "c02-tip",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Before a pronoun, it is written as this letter instead.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "ar:ت"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-tip-03",
   "scene": "c02-tip",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "A car.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-tip-04",
   "scene": "c02-tip",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "سَيَّارَةٌ",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": [
    "ar:سَيَّارَةٌ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-tip-05",
   "scene": "c02-tip",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "His car.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-tip-06",
   "scene": "c02-tip",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "سَيَّارَتُهُ",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": [
    "ar:سَيَّارَتُهُ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-tip-07",
   "scene": "c02-tip",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "A room.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-tip-08",
   "scene": "c02-tip",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "غُرْفَةٌ",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": [
    "ar:غُرْفَةٌ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-tip-09",
   "scene": "c02-tip",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Her room.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-tip-10",
   "scene": "c02-tip",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "غُرْفَتُهَا",
   "pause": 0.7,
   "cues": [
    "ar:غُرْفَتُهَا"
   ]
  }
 ]
}